* Final actual SK stage, worst adjacent sample 2.8V -> 0.2V
* ADC simplified switch (1k on) + sample capacitor. Does not model actual SAR conversion kickback.
.include vendor/combined-namespaced.lib
VS AVDD 0 DC 3
VMID VMID 0 DC 1.5
VIN prior 0 DC 0.919642857142857
R1 prior a 22.6k
R2 a plus 22.6k
C1 a out 1n
C2 plus VMID 1n
RG minus VMID 10k
RF out minus 12.4k
Xfinal plus minus AVDD 0 out TLV9052_TLV9052
RISO out adc 47
CRES adc 0 470p
CSAMP held 0 5p
VPREV prev 0 DC 2.8
Sprev held prev cp 0 SAMPSW
Sacq held adc ca 0 SAMPSW
VCP cp 0 PWL(0 1 0.9u 1 0.901u 0 8u 0)
VCA ca 0 PWL(0 0 1u 0 1.001u 1 3.5u 1 3.501u 0 8u 0)
.model SAMPSW SW(Ron=1k Roff=1e12 Vt=0.5 Vh=0)
.control
set wr_singlescale
set wr_vecnames
tran 1n 4u 0 2n
wrdata adc-sweep/r47_c470_adc5p.csv v(out) v(adc) v(held)
quit
.endc
.end
